book = Kut. Conventions and Programing Schemes.
title = Naming
=

## First symbols character.

- Upercase
> Lists type \[*.] and dictionaries type {*.}.

- Lowercase
> The rest.

## Variables and options.

* Variables are lists (type \[*]) with one and only one element.

* Options are lists  (type \[*]) with one or none element.

They are written with its first symbol in _lowercase_.

## Indexeds

The same system explained in the *First symbols character* paragraph is
applicable to variables in _indexeds_.
